Depends: paladin-seeker (>= 1.6.0)
Description: Native System Monitor for palOS
 See what the computer is doing: processor and memory use, disks, network speed, graphics,
 temperatures and battery, and every running program, with Quit and Force Quit.
 Runs on Seeker's Electron runtime.
